# TypeScript's incremental-build cache. A build artefact: it rewrites itself
# on every `npm run typecheck`, so tracking it makes a dirty tree out of
# having checked the types — and its contents are absolute paths from
# whichever machine ran last, which is not a thing to share.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo

# Screenshots taken while checking a layout against its benchmark.
# Useful to look at, not a thing the build depends on.
.screenshots/

# Throwaway browser scripts written while verifying a change. They are
# named so on purpose: one got committed with an evaluation pass, which
# is how a verification script becomes something somebody later has to
# read and wonder about.
/scratch-*

# Take Software for desktop's build output. `desktop/node_modules` is
# already covered above; this is what esbuild and electron-builder write.
/desktop/out/
/desktop/release/
# The launcher icon, copied from `public/take-app/` by `build.mjs`
# so the mark lives in one place. Generated, like `out/`.
/desktop/build/
